WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.520
Speaker 1: Let's talk about virtue signaling.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:08.080
The right says that they are against so-called
virtue signaling.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:14.500
Now, virtue signaling is when you publicly
express an opinion to try to signal that you

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.890
are morally on the right side of something
or to signal that your character is to be

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.760
respected.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:25.820
And Republican Arizona Gov. Doug Ducey is
doing exactly this.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:31.960
He has issued an executive order banning so-called
vaccine passports, of which there are none

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.940
in Arizona, nor were any coming as described
by his executive order.

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.190
First question, what is a vaccine passport?

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:45.460
Well, the executive order would ban state
and local governments in Arizona from requiring

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:53.690
Arizonans to provide proof of covid vaccination,
either to go into some kind of government

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:56.530
building or to receive something.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.890
He tweeted about it saying, quote, I've issued
an executive order banning vaccine passports

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:06.720
and preventing state and local governments
from requiring Arizonans to provide their

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:12.470
covid-19 vaccination status to receive service
or enter an area.

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:16.400
Deucy going on to tweet that quote, The residents
of our state should not be required by the

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.180
government to share their private medical
information.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.180
More on that later.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:25.620
While we strongly recommend all Arizonans
get the vaccine, it's not mandated in our

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.330
state and it never will be.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:30.370
Now, the logical question would be.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:35.290
Was the state of Arizona about to mandate
people need to get vaccinated?

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:41.970
Was the state of Arizona or were municipalities
about to say you need a vaccine in order to

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:45.610
go to this government building or that or
no, no, no.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:47.750
But this was never going to happen.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.290
So, first of all, this executive order is
focused on something which wasn't actually

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:56.159
going to be taking place now.

00:01:56.159 --> 00:02:03.070
Second question is, does this actually apply
to those who might require a vaccination like

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:05.620
a school or a business?

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.140
It does not.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:12.760
It would not prevent that if the Phenix Suns
NBA team says, you know what, at some point

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.550
once, you know, maybe by next next season
to come to our games, you're going to need

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:19.670
to provide proof of vaccination.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:21.650
This executive order does nothing to stop
that.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:25.690
The Phenix Suns could legally do that if they
want to do it.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:27.780
Schools can require vaccinations.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.940
Schools have required vaccinations for decades
in Arizona just for different vaccines.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:38.870
And so not only is this virtue signaling trash
executive order meant to stop something which

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:45.140
was not going to happen, which is mandatory
vaccination for Arizona or governments, municipalities

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.560
requiring the vaccine or requiring it to do
something that was never going to happen.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.870
This is going to create anti vaccines.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.940
Who will have heard of this?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.880
And then they will go to a business or their
kid will need a vaccine to go to school and

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:04.220
they will show up and filmed themselves saying,
do see, pass the law against this.

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.270
And of course, he didn't.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:12.400
The executive order is about what government
will or won't do with regard to vaccination.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:13.920
It has nothing to do with businesses.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.580
It has nothing to do with schools.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:25.489
So it's it's it's a combination of pointless
virtue signaling with the addition of creating

00:03:25.489 --> 00:03:31.489
more problems for schools and businesses who
are able to require a coronavirus vaccination.

00:03:31.489 --> 00:03:37.650
Now, a related topic in that second tweet,
Deucy said, residents of our state should

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:42.700
not be required by the government to share
their private medical information.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:48.920
Now, is he on the same page with that claim
