to covid vaccination requirements?

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.640
This guy is pathetic.

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:20.019
One of the worst of the worst one of the worst
handling's in the country of the coronavirus

00:04:20.019 --> 00:04:25.419
pandemic and now the executive order, which
doesn't actually deal with what people think

00:04:25.419 --> 00:04:29.580
it deals with and deals only with something
